WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.730
- See I feel like
marshmallows are like camping

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.843
and then Peeps are like glamping.

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:09.461
- Well, that's that on that fam.

00:00:09.461 --> 00:00:11.873
(whips through air)
(hinge squeaks)

00:00:11.873 --> 00:00:14.000
(fun music)

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.360
- Hey everyone, Emily here.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.360
I'm super excited for Easter.

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:19.662
I want to share one of my
favorite family traditions,

00:00:19.662 --> 00:00:21.080
