sparkly baby bird die.

00:00:57.545 --> 00:00:58.430
(birds chirping)

00:00:58.430 --> 00:01:00.960
- Well, when you put it like
that, now I'm more excited.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:02.323
- I hope their eyes melt off.

00:01:02.323 --> 00:01:03.240
- Oof.

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:04.513
